GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN STEP 5: View All Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN STEP 6: View Revenue Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/revenue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN STEP 7: View Popular Routes
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/popular-routes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN STEP 8: Add New Aircraft
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/aircraft
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manufacturer": "Airbus",
  "model": "A380",
  "totalSeats": 500
}

### ADMIN STEP 9: Update Aircraft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/aircraft/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manufacturer": "Airbus",
  "model": "A380-800",
  "totalSeats": 525
}

### ADMIN STEP 10: View Bookings for Specific Flight
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/by-flight/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
